{"author":{"id":"a3a282966ced55effb4560271fcd98e13241af24ea76b00ec76a0f18154bc8ee"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1790642009,"nonce":"P9bUJke6ONSL+Ob3V6Q3+N/qF6I=","message":"Landed 2026-09-28: the gantt kind of package tui (tui/gantt.go, gantt_view.go) and nesting on the list and the gantt (tui/nest.go), to doc/design/terminal-renderer.md, which gained a Gantt section and a built Nesting section with the calls made while building:\n\n- The only edits a gantt makes are moves, as on a board: Enter opens the row in show, copy copies the id. The cursor is a cell (row, period); up/down keep the period.\n- Grab needs no rank. Left/right shift by one period: first cell moves start, last cell moves stop, between them both. A one-cell bar grows (left the start, right the stop) rather than shifts, because it is on its first and last cell at once. Up/down need rank. One drop is one set with up to three keys. A shift is counted from the stored date, so dragging back lands on the day it left; a day stays a day, a time keeps its clock.\n- One date is a milestone (a diamond); no dates is nothing to move. A parent with no dates draws its children's envelope, folded or not.\n- `label` is a label column left of the chart, not text on the bar. Extent is from/to, else the data's, else today; today is marked on the rule; the chart grows with a drag past its edge. Periods are whole (Monday weeks, aligned quarters), a day 3 cells wide, the others 4.\n- Nesting: `expand` names the relation whose targets nest under a row, and a derived inverse (children) resolves through the stored side (parent) off the whole store. depth 1 unless named, 0 unlimited; a row at the depth is a leaf. z folds, Tab into the first child, Shift-Tab to the parent; the list's up/down stay on the level, the gantt's walk every row. A group is the root's; a rank moves a row among its siblings, subtree included. The tree indents the id behind ▾/▸.\n\nTests: tui/gantt_test.go and tui/nest_test.go. The GUI half of the story (6285d60) waits on the gui process (8b06191).","files":null}]}